# APK dataset, dropped on the deploy server by the private analysis repository
# and hydrated by `scripts/load-apk-lab.mjs` at prebuild. Never committed: the
# private repo stays the truth, the site only derives a projection of it. The
# committed fixture under __tests__/fixtures/apk-lab is what keeps the reading
# surfaces covered in CI, where the real dataset never lands.
public/data/apk-lab/
